{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFhQdWeygNoY7AowXhQX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I approved all three rows on the re-sit (`OUTCOME: APPROVE rows=3`). The verdict is committed as `bc728e7f1` in `docs/reviews/wi-957/004-ADJUDICATE-ea2c0cf.md`, with both required trailers.\n\n**How sitting 003's findings were answered:**\n- **SR-241's perspective record now exists.** When I ran its check with `--strict`, it reported no findings. PERFORMANCE produced the row, and every other hat that applies gives a no-finding I judged adequate, including security and integrity: a read-only gate that writes nothing and refuses before any brief exists.\n- **LLR-341 states its bound:** no verified record among the first 64 commits the search examines, the reviewed commit included. A new test checks it both ways. With 63 record-only commits above the attested one, the brief renders; two more make it refuse, naming the bound.\n- **The skill-text clause has left the spine.** That skill is this repo's own unshipped tooling, so its text stays checked by an ordinary test, and TC-372 was retired with a record of why. LLR-341 now holds one decision.\n- **TC-371** now states the tree/parent \"both values\" clause and the walk-bound clause, and every row of the lane's arms map has an existing test.\n\n**One observation, not a finding:** SR-241's acceptance criteria state no depth limit, while LLR-341 refuses past 64 commits. I accepted it for three reasons:\n- At the limit the render refuses, and the refusal names the recording step, so nothing is let through.\n- No supported workflow puts anywhere near 64 record-only commits between an attest and a review.\n- The existing governing walk under SR-156 leaves its limit unstated in the same way.\n\nAs before, the hook's `format` step was skipped because ruff isn't installed for its Python 3.12. I left the coordinator's `.requested` marker untracked."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4118,"cache_read_input_tokens":398446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4118},"output_tokens":628,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f031c6a5-ecf0-490f-9890-c7a8a87f92fc","uuid":"bff0d45c-1dd4-4ae3-bbbc-d570586cba3a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:28:11.865Z","request_id":"req_011CgFhQd8LNrdBX7iMaz959"}
